# Nexus local patch — uncommitted working-tree diff of submodule 'mcpelauncher-linker/bionic'
# Applies on pinned commit: 081b55b1f45745b1e6f93c49b3831107542a426d
# Captured 2026-07-12 from the exact tree that built Nexus Bedrock Runtime v1.7.6-572-nexus5.
# NOT an intentional patch: macOS case-insensitive-filesystem checkout artifact (xt_MARK.h vs xt_mark.h etc. collide, so uppercase headers got the lowercase files' content). Recorded for exact-tree fidelity; harmless to the macOS build (Linux-kernel netfilter headers are not compiled into it).
# Apply with: git -C <manifest>/mcpelauncher-linker/bionic apply <this file>
#
diff --git a/libc/kernel/uapi/linux/netfilter/xt_CONNMARK.h b/libc/kernel/uapi/linux/netfilter/xt_CONNMARK.h
